# Unity generated
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/
/.utmp/

# Staging and raw copies: large and not gate-checked, so kept local only.
# Commit an asset only after it passes the gate and moves into Assets/_Game or Assets/ThirdParty.
/[Aa]ssets/_Incoming/**
!/[Aa]ssets/_Incoming/OldGame/
!/[Aa]ssets/_Incoming/OldGame/README.md
!/[Aa]ssets/_Incoming/OldGame/README.md.meta
/SourceAssets/OldGame/**
!/SourceAssets/OldGame/README.md

# Addressables / asset pack build output
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*
/ServerData/

# IDE / generated project files
.vs/
.idea/
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
